          "source": "SAToplam 2.0 Writing · Topic 1 · Q2",
          "passageTitle": "Boundaries — Q2",
          "passage": "Writer Silvia Moreno-Garcia's love of short fiction began when she read a collection of Edgar Allan Poe's stories as a child, and she would develop into a prolific short story writer herself, publishing pieces like \"Ahuizotl\" (2015) and \"Water\" (2007). Yet she's best known as novelist, in part due to her ______ Gothic (2020), earning a spot on the New York Times Best Sellers list.",
